webp?t=1787557520 width=1560 height=467 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620950/extras/696b55cea19700af00a5b86dae133563.avif?t=1787557520\" width=600 height=178 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER THE SECTORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through increasingly brutal sectors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate waves, hunt elites for Satellite upgrades, and prepare for dreadful bosses.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-parry combat:</strong> turn enemy's strength against them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep customization:</strong> mix and match for hundreds of build possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-stakes roguelite:</strong> few HPs, permanent unlocks, infinite replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620950/extras/01f9a86e19392dc7bf7586646dad096e.poster.avif?t=1787557520\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620950/extras/01f9a86e19392dc7bf7586646dad096e.webm?t=1787557520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620950/extras/01f9a86e19392dc7bf7586646dad096e.mp4?t=1787557520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFINITE CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After having conquered all of the game campaign sectors, get ready for infinite <strong>challenges</strong>, <strong>builds</strong> and <strong>parries</strong> in the <strong>Endless sector</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb